            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A study of frequency of occurrence of signs and symptoms of temporomandibular dysfunction (TMD) by means of questionnaires and clinical examination was performed at New York University College of Dentistry. Ninety children, ages 3 to 16, were examined.</AbstractText>
